   ],
   "key_quote": "Six hundred millions of such Apsaras with amazing dazzle have emerged from the churning of Milky Ocean, oh, descendent of Kakutstha, and their maidservants who emerged along with them are innumerable.",
   "shloka": {
    "number": "1-45-34",
